{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo of <i>Sheltered from the Storm</i> offers a first glimpse into the game\u2019s world, featuring one chapter of the main story and 5 custom-designed scenes: <strong>Bomb Shelter, Abandoned City, Forest Refuge, Gas Station Outpost, and Lake Island</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058030/extras/a0eca8e279f8d2b5fa5f432e35df9b8e.poster.avif?t=1759311616\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058030/extras/a0eca8e279f8d2b5fa5f432e35df9b8e.webm?t=1759311616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058030/extras/a0eca8e279f8d2b5fa5f432e35df9b8e.mp4?t=1759311616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is crafted to showcase immersive weather, ambient soundscapes, and quiet reflection in a post-apocalyptic setting.<br>There\u2019s no combat or resource management\u2014only the sound of rain, distant walkers, and the fleeting peace found in shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058030/extras/d78ae14ac3f191bc6388900ed447bd78.poster.avif?t=1759311616\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058030/extras/d78ae14ac3f191bc6388900ed447bd78.webm?t=1759311616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058030/extras/d78ae14ac3f191bc6388900ed447bd78.mp4?t=1759311616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058